# Stripe (tip jar) — only needed for the Buy-me-a-coffee button.
# Without these the site builds and renders normally; the button shows
# "Payments are not configured yet." on click.
#
# Local: copy this file to .dev.vars (wrangler pages dev reads it).
# Production: set the same names in Cloudflare Pages → Settings →
# Environment variables (or `wrangler pages secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`).
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# Optional but recommended — product id from:
#   node --env-file=.dev.vars tools/create-coffee-product.mjs
# (without it each checkout creates an inline product in your dashboard)
STRIPE_COFFEE_PRODUCT_ID=
